Package: OSPExplorerGolem
Title: OSP Data Explorer - Golem Version
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Sia", "Mirza", , "siawasch.mirzaee@gmail.com", role = c("cre", "aut"))
Description: A modular Shiny application for exploring Open Systems 
    Pharmacology (OSP) Suite data using the Golem framework. This application 
    provides tools for loading, validating, and visualizing PBPK/QSP simulation 
    data alongside observed clinical data. Built with pharmaceutical research 
    and GxP-compliant practices in mind.
